    "title": "Texarkana man accused of faking death arrested - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago TEXARKANA, Texas — A Texarkana man accused of staging his own death to evade child sex abuse charges has been added to the Texas Most Wanted list. Investigators say Gordon Lemons faked a suicide on the Red River Bridge last year after his GPS ankle monitor malfunctioned. His body was never recovered, and police later tracked his motorcycle hundreds of miles away. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
